OL,3,GNEWSABelfast comedian criticised for
OL,4,Arape 'joke' about assault victim
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Belfast comedian has been criticised
OL,7,Ffor making a rape "joke" about a woman
OL,8,Fwho had recently spoken publicly about
OL,9,Fbeing the victim of a sexual assault.
OL,11,FVittorio Angelone referred to content
OL,12,Fcreator Rebecca Goodwin in a remark
OL,13,Fabout rape which he made in a podcast
OL,14,Fepisode in 2025.
OL,16,FGoodwin, who had previously reported a
OL,17,Frape to police, said it will "forever
OL,18,Flive with me that it was allowed for my
OL,19,Fname to be used as the punchline of a
OL,20,Fmalicious "joke" about such a serious
OL,21,Fissue".
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
